  "title": "New Arrivals | Balenciaga Debuts Winter 26 Collection: Vintage Goatskin and the Fan Carry All Bag",
  "original_title": "新包 | Balenciaga 上架冬季26系列新包：复古山羊皮，Fan Carry All 手袋",
  "excerpt": "Balenciaga's Winter 26 bags feature the new Fan Carry All and vintage goatskin updates to Rodeo and Le City, evoking nostalgic elegance.",
