      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Balenciaga has just unveiled its Winter 26 bag collection, led by the new Fan Carry All, crafted from polished lambskin into a soft, gathered silhouette whose rounded, fluid lines evoke an elegant vintage mood. Icons like the Rodeo and Le City are reimagined in vintage goatskin, its mottled, light-and-dark grain resembling the patina of years gone by and lending each bag a nostalgic air.",
