    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· Fan Carry All ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Debuting on the Winter 26 runway, the Fan Carry All is made from soft, finely polished lambskin, with side gathering that recalls the pleating techniques of haute couture, giving the body a more fluid, dimensional shape. The leather drawstring ends are finished with a square cutout B buckle, adjustable through eyelets to vary the opening's width, while a concealed magnetic closure sits inside. Dual leather handles and a detachable strap allow for hand-carry, shoulder, and crossbody wear. It arrives in two sizes, small and medium, and two colorways: gray-brown gradient and black polished leather.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
