    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Le 7 small bowling bag joins the lineup in a new nutmeg hue, its smooth, supple lambskin shaped into a clever \"bag within a bag\" silhouette. Open the top turn-lock to reveal three separate compartments—a playful design of a small bag hidden inside a larger one that speaks to modern life's demand for versatility. The rose quartz pink lining creates a striking contrast with the understated, deep earth-tone exterior.",
