      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Le City family welcomes a new Clutch chain pouch, its minimalist, slim rectangular profile with a flap closure accented by the line's signature distressed metal studs, belt buckles, and whipstitch tassels. It comes in four versions: black grained lambskin with gold hardware, metallic silver grained lambskin with silver hardware, pale terracotta, and caramel waxed suede calfskin. The sliding metal chain strap converts easily between single and double shoulder lengths, adapting to shoulder, crossbody, and clutch carry.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
