    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "For the new season, the Rodeo messenger and top-handle bags are crafted from vintage goatskin. Naturally supple and hard-wearing, the goatskin is tanned to bring out a mottled, rubbed-off grain that casts a retro filter over each bag. Rendered in caramel or brick red, they carry the distinctive charm of an antique piece.",
